# F178 — num_ctx dropped from 32768 to 16384. The F170 Juice Shop bench
# peaked at ~1.3K tokens (ctx 4% OK), so 16K is 5x the observed
# working-set ceiling. The change frees ~0.5 GB VRAM (RTX 5070 Ti
# Laptop went from 94%→85% usage, 12% CPU spillover → 0%) and leaves
# headroom for nomic-embed-text to also serve from GPU. If a longer
# engagement ever needs more, raise back per-instance with the Ollama
# ``num_ctx`` request parameter or bake a higher value via env.
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER num_predict 4096
# F179 — temperature 1.0 (canonical Harmony default) gave σ=2.83 on
# n=3 with findings ranging 0-6 across identical runs. For agentic
# pentest where we want reproducible findings, 0.3 reduces variance
# while keeping enough diversity for the model to explore alt paths
# when a tool fails. OpenAI's own gpt-oss agentic guide recommends
# 0.2-0.4 for tool-use scenarios; canonical 1.0 is the chat-completion
# default, not the agentic default.
PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 1.0
PARAMETER top_k 0
PARAMETER min_p 0
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.0
PARAMETER stop "<|endoftext|>"
PARAMETER stop "<|return|>"
PARAMETER stop "<|call|>"

